{"id":"tak","lemma":"так","pos":"adv","rank":17,"glosses":["like that, like this (in that/this way, in that/this manner) (translated as \"that\" or \"this\" with some verbs)","so; in the negative: that (to a high degree)","so much; in the negative: that much (to a high degree) (translated as \"so\" or (in the negative) \"that\" with some verbs that are translated with adjectives in English)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/79/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Почему так холодно?","en":"Why's it so cold?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267813","words":[{"g":"why"},null,{"g":"coldly"}]},{"text":"Так что вы сделали?","en":"So, what have you done?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270164","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Так ты мне скажешь?","en":"You'll tell me, won't you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1278652","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"}]},{"text":"Я не хочу ждать так долго.","en":"I don't want to wait so long.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1839","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to wait for"},null,{"g":"a long time"}]},{"text":"Здесь не так плохо.","en":"It isn't so bad here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270279","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"bad, badly"}]}]}